Utilities — water, energy and the services that sustain other work (@utilities: 0, is #chapter, #part-of "../engineering/Engineering.lingua#r_5DA6VY09MAD2N8D9SH0FFJVV68", #making-and-maintenance "water-and-sanitation/Water-sanitation-and-industrial-utilities.lingua#r_7B9GRCJFHVBEEQEXKWCR2QMMPN", #making-and-maintenance "industrial-gases-vacuum-and-high-purity-supplies/Industrial-gases-and-vacuum.lingua#r_3GHQJEYMYEN6JDKSF4PPJ403RF", #contains "electricity-infrastructure-and-energy-storage/Electricity-infrastructure-and-energy-storage.lingua#r_5WDHZ2EBHAKP6Y0H4DABH0MC5H", #contains "fuels-hydrogen-and-thermal-energy-supply/Fuels-hydrogen-and-thermal-energy-supply.lingua#r_7SK09P8H8A7Z0J80NTSFQX9H97", #contains "water-and-sanitation/Water-sanitation-and-industrial-utilities.lingua#r_7B9GRCJFHVBEEQEXKWCR2QMMPN", #contains "industrial-gases-vacuum-and-high-purity-supplies/Industrial-gases-and-vacuum.lingua#r_3GHQJEYMYEN6JDKSF4PPJ403RF") { r_23Z5YYXGRA1JDFD4BAM955JMNX
Understand the water, energy and supporting services that make households, laboratories and production facilities work over time.

[Water, sanitation and industrial utilities — from sources to continuing service](water-and-sanitation/Water-sanitation-and-industrial-utilities.lingua#r_7B9GRCJFHVBEEQEXKWCR2QMMPN) follows sources, quality, treatment, delivery, sanitation, industrial use and continuing operation. [Electrical power engineering — sources, networks, machines and continuing service](../engineering/electrical-power-engineering/Electrical-power-engineering.lingua#r_300EPNGATK7PHWNZCQFBXGZFCQ) develops electrical service, while [Fluid dynamics — motion, forces, transport and evidence](../physics/fluid-dynamics/Fluid-dynamics.lingua#r_7PQW1WDHK708BFV23MD8ET61VZ) supplies the shared account of fluid motion and physical evidence.

[Industrial gases, vacuum and high-purity supplies](industrial-gases-vacuum-and-high-purity-supplies/Industrial-gases-and-vacuum.lingua#r_3GHQJEYMYEN6JDKSF4PPJ403RF) begins with shared quantities and develops gas production, separation, purification and vacuum transport. Pump mechanisms and surface inventories continue into storage, thermal delivery, regulation, distribution, purge, reserve and quality. Pressure, composition, leak and flow measurement now connect calibration and uncertainty to advanced metrology research. Operation, failure investigation, maintenance, energy and recovery lead into nineteen advanced investigations, integrated systems and independent research.

Follow the dependencies, people, measurements, spare parts and maintenance that keep a service available. Related work continues through [Hephaestus](../Hephaestus.lingua#r_00000000000000000000002001), [Engineering — systems, design, construction, and operation](../engineering/Engineering.lingua#r_5DA6VY09MAD2N8D9SH0FFJVV68), [Earth — materials, processes, and geological history](../../gaia/earth/Earth.lingua#r_5H7Y6QD1FW4Z0JJ6C7SH4DDHXH) and [Philosophy](../../../scholazein/philosophy/Philosophy.lingua#r_00000000000000000000001001).

[Development scope: Energy and utilities](Utilities.lingua#r_23Z5YYXGRA1JDFD4BAM955JMNX).

**Scope:** Account for a service's energy or water; follow a supply from source to use; investigate reliability and upkeep. Begin with relevant quantities and balances; operating, designing, and manufacturing utility equipment remain separate goals.

**Branches:**

- [Electricity infrastructure and energy storage](electricity-infrastructure-and-energy-storage/Electricity-infrastructure-and-energy-storage.lingua#r_5WDHZ2EBHAKP6Y0H4DABH0MC5H)
